  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_7aa77c31d1214bcd821bed54caa4ce23",
      "statement": "`AIService` (`src/market/ai_service.py`) is the single owner of AI behavior in retail-portfolio: it assembles context from the security, price and note repositories, builds prompts, calls an OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint via `AsyncOpenAI`, and is consumed by both the three market-router AI endpoints and the asynchronous note-title Huey task.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/__init__.py#L91-L91",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c87fb99eb6e898a7fb5271aacdb54e17519b9977b681ebb91aff21c2fa3bb1a7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/ai_service.py#L36-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:21be2468d7e2814a5ffda162165cd6f12ce87339632eba4d91d999d7a5962b96:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/router.py#L890-L966",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2253466eb102c5a581ffeff49f6077e4237a87247fefa8512ae1e3af711a18df:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/task.py#L43-L52",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1da26e762cb2d46d71939e4fe1f13b34a12bbfbd6b84ab8b57170de3046a9ae:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_374391e566be49cba83d3f645ab31241",
      "statement": "`_gather_context` fans out to `SecurityRepository.get_by_id_or_fail`, `PriceRepository.get_latest_price`, `SecurityNoteRepository.get_by_security_and_user` with `limit=50`, and `PriceRepository.get_prices` over a window starting at the 1st of the previous month minus 90 days and ending today, but retains only the last 30 rows for the prompt; the resulting `AIContext` carries `security`, `current_price` (or `None`), `notes`, and `recent_prices`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/ai_service.py#L57-L108",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:db69c9b9605cc4c593441f8743c48b423b748b611df8788c4bd88ffdc6811501:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fb53d5357546414e9a044299c226d0ce",
      "statement": "`_build_context_prompt` sends only the last 5 notes to the model and truncates each note body to 200 characters, omits the recent-price trend block entirely when `recent_prices` is empty, and computes the trend percentage change between the first and last of the 30 recent closes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/ai_service.py#L168-L224",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7b5758b200034485708095a65d63005a014eb60861d660a379263920d7a1c947:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e1709a01cb8c4ce9b1bd00097c0b3e77",
      "statement": "The three AI endpoints are authenticated `POST` routes rate-limited at `5/minute` and all return `AIAnalysisResponse` (`content`, `generated_at`) with `generated_at` stamped in the router as `datetime.now(UTC).isoformat()`: `/securities/{security_id}/ai/fundamentals`, `/securities/{security_id}/ai/summarize-notes`, and `/securities/{security_id}/ai/portfolio-debate`, the last accepting `AIAnalysisRequest.portfolio_context` and substituting `\"No portfolio context provided.\"` when it is missing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/router.py#L891-L966",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7a5d7bb0ee9d8e3e98743172b47d6b099d20cac3d78f95e16fc6d13ce39f7a2e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/schema.py#L242-L248",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:879eabe548825e67c5fb3054f20ad73edde346a6990e1e7a3848bf780ecb9d8a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d7f4e3be8b674408b091c771460ba682",
      "statement": "`summarize_notes` short-circuits to the literal string `\"No notes found for this security.\"` when the gathered context has no notes, so that endpoint performs no provider call and can never return 503 or 504.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/ai_service.py#L247-L268",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0f0b4ceff0ff428309cbad7547bbab534e4085e2624154bdc4fc534db2edbfc8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f4f50b2a46a640aa96f0a8fd9ad33a0d",
      "statement": "`_call_ai_api` issues chat completions with `temperature=0.7`, `max_tokens=2000` and a 60-second default timeout using `self._api_model` (from `settings.ai_api_model`), re-raises any SDK exception as `RuntimeError(\"AI service unavailable: ...\") from None`, raises `RuntimeError` on empty content and `TypeError` on non-string content, and strips DeepSeek-style think blocks with a DOTALL regex before returning the trimmed string.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/ai_service.py#L110-L166",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:146ebb4be3b12f59e181f43fbb804ab20a3b620f0b28c17938f0b05432900aad:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_51278bfa47094d5b902ca3cc7d031dce",
      "statement": "The market router maps `TimeoutError` from an AI service call to HTTP 504 `\"AI analysis timed out\"` and `RuntimeError` to HTTP 503 with the exception text as `detail`, so an unexpected `TypeError` from non-string content is not caught and surfaces as a 500.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/market/ai_service.py#L160-L166",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:42f65154ef69ea6253b1235e82e2d457c6c7d3107a2f0eceaece8c17b9338416:"
        },
