      "id": "claim_3f9d31d5322d46ce89f113a75bfe0f6b",
      "statement": "`StubAIService` accepts `*args, **kwargs` and implements only `analyze_fundamentals`, `summarize_notes` and `analyze_portfolio_fit` with fixed markdown strings, so it has no `generate_note_title` method and does not cover the note-title task path.",
