    {
      "id": "claim_144b1e6ed58e4dac95ce3aa80026118f",
      "statement": "AI calls must be stubbed in tests: `tests/conftest.py` sets `STUB_EXTERNAL_API=true` and `ENVIRONMENT=test` before importing the app, so the whole suite resolves `StubAIService` and constructs no `AsyncOpenAI` client; `tests/routers/test_notes.py` additionally patches `src.market.task.Container` to return an `AsyncMock(spec=AIService)`, patches `src.market.task.huey.svcs_registry` with a `MagicMock`, patches `src.market.router.generate_note_title_task` to assert the enqueue arguments, and then awaits `_generate_note_title` directly.",
