    {
      "id": "claim_3e7f7127b006490aa5709d44ddc72bef",
      "statement": "`ai_service_factory` wires `settings.ai_api_endpoint`, `settings.ai_api_key` and `settings.ai_api_model` into the constructor, which builds `AsyncOpenAI(api_key=..., base_url=api_endpoint.replace(\"/chat/completions\", \"\"))` — that replacement is what allows `AI_API_ENDPOINT` to be either a bare base URL or a full completions path.",
