    {
      "id": "claim_3a97f9f13ca44c64a1511d4b6b992905",
      "statement": "The frontend mirrors the three endpoints exactly: `frontend/src/lib/api/aiService.ts` posts `{}` to the fundamentals and summarize-notes routes and the `AIAnalysisRequest` body to the portfolio-debate route; the sidebar group exposes them as Explain Fundamentals, Summarize Notes and Portfolio Debate, with the portfolio action currently sending the placeholder `'Analyzing in isolation for now.'` as `portfolio_context`, and the response dialog offers retry plus 'Save as Note'.",
      "evidence": [
